  "question": {
    "text": "If the system of equations\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& 2 x-y+z=4 \\\\\n& 5 x+\\lambda y+3 z=12 \\\\\n& 100 x-47 y+\\mu z=212\n\\end{aligned}$\nhas infinitely many solutions, then $\\mu-2 \\lambda$ is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
