  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & 2 x-y+z=4 \\\\ & 5 x+\\lambda y+3 z=12 \\\\ & 100 x-47 y+\\mu z=212 \\\\ & \\Delta x=\\Delta y=\\Delta z=0 \\\\ & \\Delta z=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}2 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 5 & \\lambda & 12 \\\\ 100 & -47 & 212\\end{array}\\right|=0 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow 2(212 \\lambda+564)+1(1060-1200) \\\\ & \\Rightarrow 424 \\lambda+1128-140-940-400 \\lambda=0 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\lambda=-2 \\\\ & \\quad \\Delta y=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 5 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 100 & -47 & \\mu\\end{array}\\right|=0 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow 2(-2 \\mu+141)+1(5 \\mu-300)+1(-235+200)=0 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\quad \\mu=53 \\\\ & \\mu-2 \\lambda=53-2(-2)=57\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
